{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "f61ea05b6a84a7be8bf93c0fb10f2f0fb5f46343ceeb14fc44684f89275063f1", "ja": "オールオッケー、ルルルルル☆", "zh": "万事OK，噜噜噜噜噜☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "eff13b5e9e4100261d89abebaf327bff035322d5e8906ce28e9b12e825d72ea3", "ja": "天体公演が無事終わり、ホッとするプロデュ\nーサー。数日が経ち、まつりはまだ納得でき\nていない様子。特にマシュマロが苦手だと言\nった事を気にしているようだったが、貴重な\n体験ができたなと諭され納得するのだった。", "zh": "天体演出顺利结束，制作人松了一口气。\n几天过去，茉莉似乎还是有些无法释怀。\n虽然她看起来特别在意自己说过不擅长应付棉花糖一事，\n但被劝导说这也是一次宝贵的体验后，总算是接受了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "48a7a975ea99a7da99abcdd2cc1ce2c02fb3dabf844172f6d36bd5d5468d53f2", "ja": "（『タウラス』の天体公演は、大盛況で終わった。\n正直、無事に終わってホッとしているな……）", "zh": "（《金牛座》的天体公演圆满落幕，反响热烈。说实话，能平安结束真是让我松了口气……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "20e95ce077e1b7476a46ce329bc2548c604b6fb7d69dd3785f18b47a296d4b61", "ja": "（それから数日後。美也と未来は、\n記憶がなくなった時の事を、まつりに説明していた）", "zh": "（几天后，美也和未来向茉莉说明了失去记忆时发生的事。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "8fcae0f6ee6631848d93c3e21b4af2a2b29a5fd7ff3de4409584be06ca90ae69", "ja": "……と、いうことがあったんですよ～。\nまつりちゃん、わかりましたか～？", "zh": "……事情就是这样啦～。\n小祭，明白了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "7a6e662f8233a50d523261939dc6739340e279f6b0a7c67be58c529618e75dbd", "ja": "ほ？　そんなこと、あるはずがないのです。\nウソをついてはダメなのですよ、美也ちゃん！", "zh": "哦？怎么可能会有那种事呢。\n不可以撒谎哦，美也！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "8a4e659d76d1dd355cb0aa00f284f4b2eed243fab1450d0e10fd3288fbf2e7b5", "ja": "ウソじゃなくて、本当なんです～。\nそうですよね～？　未来ちゃん。", "zh": "不是谎话，是真的啦～。\n对吧～？未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "7ea921f890fcf07977ef2843527893e3046f3ca12f698ae0874d092da0559dc5", "ja": "うん！　そうだよ、まつりちゃん！\n本当に、そういうことがあったんだから！", "zh": "嗯！没错，茉莉！\n真的发生过那种事嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "52d5f29c72fdddce322a2a76c923e6d5c380724de842aeef94792ec48e796e96", "ja": "未来ちゃんまで、姫をだまそうとしているのです？\nぷんすか！なのです。", "zh": "连未来也想骗本公主吗？\n气鼓鼓的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "25124d78d357caf4a94455f482fd936e672eb30953e63a9aa9566ad53716a630", "ja": "まつり、ふたりの言う事は本当なんだ……\nというか、どうして嘘だと思うんだ？", "zh": "祭，未来她们说的都是真的……\n话说回来，你为什么会觉得她们在说谎？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "06a6a7e891b658d1705a3725cc46712d259d25ae4c266bc6673e07b72bbd6cd3", "ja": "だって、納得がいかないのです！　特に……\n姫が、マシュマロは苦手だと言ったというところ！", "zh": "因为，人家就是无法接受嘛！尤其是……公主说自己不擅长吃棉花糖这一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "c2f33dc161765af682582e4f99db7cbcb3ab4e9de83f979faa860a9136158004", "ja": "まつりは、マシュマロが大好きなのです。\nプロフィールにも、ちゃんとそう書いているのです～！", "zh": "茉莉可是最喜欢棉花糖的。\n简介里也好好地这么写着呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "38a4c994005526f5d0adfaf67232ec2e9e736b92d02b0a0f201f7fed3bcb1c4e", "ja": "でも、本当にそう言ったんだよ～！　まつりちゃん、\n実はマシュマロ苦手なんじゃないの？", "zh": "可是，她真的就是这么说的嘛～！茉莉，\n你其实不喜欢棉花糖吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "4655b3826c8bbd633321984a0ad66275480ebb7b9a819efbb0999a19ea3afda0", "ja": "！　……そんなことはないのです。マシュマロは\nふわふわできゅーとで、姫にぴったりなのです！", "zh": "！……才没有那回事呢。棉花糖又软绵绵又可爱，和本公主最相配了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "2f96d5955c1bdaea0bdd231bcf2f069b7e369044920bb85fe9b80b996ab8e44f", "ja": "未来ちゃんは、いじわるなのです！\nもう漫画を貸してあげないのですよ！", "zh": "未来好坏！  \n我再也不借漫画给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "4823c3da3be19cdd8b3cbaa28072ad00afdc3b874e07d20757ae5ef92e4e5a60", "ja": "ええーっ！？　そんなぁ！\nまつりちゃんのオススメ、絶対はずれないんだもん！", "zh": "诶诶——！？不要这样嘛！\n小祭推荐的漫画，绝对不会踩雷的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "156ac2e16a392f867fefd5ec98bc729b1dd3c9cd9f43dfe116d895082be29dbf", "ja": "ケンカはダメですよ～、まつりちゃん、未来ちゃん。\nみんなで、仲良くしましょうね～。", "zh": "不可以吵架哦～，小茉莉、小未来。\n大家要和睦相处哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0c50bffe3b6a64004823a962ffd007cc6a6395c7511fdb5ecaad453daf36bd00", "ja": "そういえば、青羽さんがココア用に買っておいてくれた\nマシュマロが、まだ残っていたような……。", "zh": "说起来，青羽小姐之前买来配可可的\n棉花糖，好像还剩着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "5c656d955823f1268378e5f79780e0b41ad7e67924c90ee192ac235c77ed2278", "ja": "それでは、仲直りのお茶にしましょうか～。\n私、ココアを入れてきますね～。", "zh": "那么，就来喝杯和好茶吧～  \n我去泡可可哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0a100698fe407cbad0dc03af024b5265c8c590da9a3efac7187b9b14b0fb69b5", "ja": "美也、手伝うよ。", "zh": "美也，我来帮忙吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "8cfd543e1aeee442e36aec66b88a600c3fc2f5f4049a65a3322f924bcf830d9e", "ja": "お待たせしました～。牛乳を温めすぎたのか、\nマシュマロが全部溶けてしまいました～。", "zh": "让你久等了～。可能是牛奶加热过头了，棉花糖全都融化掉了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "2cef113f3d5582b1da45b5251a893e02a61092ae42274760951d9ab187a24128", "ja": "マシュマロは、溶けていてもおいしいのです！\n未来ちゃん、いただくのです。", "zh": "棉花糖就算融化了也很好吃哦！\n未来，开动啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "32c7cdf70b1bc81fa64733fc9d2120dcfc0a561b7536c38e19a51329b03d4345", "ja": "はーい、いただきまーす！\n……うん、おいしー♪", "zh": "好——我要开动啦！\n……嗯，好好吃♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "a39470ba858c728fe92a4ce219d3acc40c545d033eeea13f9a26be25cedb8fed", "ja": "それにしても、不思議な出来事だったな～。\n{$P$}さんも、そう思いますよね？", "zh": "话说回来，真是件不可思议的事啊～。\n{$P$}先生也这么觉得吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "764a4a3b14c16317d67d8917e2e2cacb2607ab61414301e9d5c21f6deeb96d3e", "ja": "ああ、そうだな……。今までにも、\n不思議な事は色々あったけど……。", "zh": "啊，确实是这样……之前也发生过各种各样不可思议的事情，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "10884da99071af20fae5f2c2575d0446c7a7dfcac5a31aee99a856f9fcc2b80a", "ja": "みんなといると、これからも、不思議なことが\nたくさん起きそうな予感がしますな～。ふふふ。", "zh": "和大家在一起的话，总觉得今后也会发生\n许多不可思议的事呢～。呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "ca0a85b7e11e22cc1882d2396faba66a4ab5a673c694a7615d305c25f4e58b1b", "ja": "むう……姫だけ仲間はずれみたいで、\nちっとも面白くないのです～！", "zh": "唔……感觉只有公主一个人被排除在外，\n一点意思都没有～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "56809e827a9bc8a1f64b4497a2420ff9e770db68cf12e770101eda7de45ca906", "ja": "でも記憶を失くしてる間のまつりちゃん、\nなんだか楽しそうだったよ！　ね、美也ちゃん。", "zh": "不过，失去记忆期间的茉莉，好像过得很开心呢！对吧，美也。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1027_042miy", "source_sha256": "30dbb518d451e1e9a637cbca9839bcf2b404de4efb378e7249a87cb28e7d3ebc", "ja": "はい～。今のまつりちゃんも、\n記憶喪失のまつりちゃんとも、仲良くできましたし～。", "zh": "是呀～我和现在的茉莉，还有失去记忆的茉莉，都相处得很愉快呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1028_042miy", "source_sha256": "4ed66d3e6381c9bae61ece0ecbfe05c3d739a37870e5f5b88dda7e598913831a", "ja": "劇場のみんなと、改めてごあいさつするなんて。\nとっても、貴重な体験だったと思います～。", "zh": "能和剧场的大家重新打招呼，真是一次非常宝贵的经历呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "091ab303287a9b724340cbec0ae1f7e370f92d872f21384fcbb7153ce2297a8d", "ja": "そうだな……もしかしたらまつりが、\n一番貴重な体験をしたのかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊……说不定，反而是茉莉经历了最为珍贵的体验呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "8744b79f18255c4c90da0b461e39791b5087426fcb8937ff52c56af1ff3988cb", "ja": "ほ？　貴重な体験……。\n言われてみると、そうかもしれないのです。", "zh": "咦？贵重的体验……这么一说，或许确实是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0121_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0121_story_07_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "0a1647de2cd2dd953c354c39a61ef35e29c21825289a6c47788b4f1b931cca2c", "ja": "仕方がないので、今回の件は、不問にするのです。\n未来ちゃん、美也ちゃんも、わかりましたか？", "zh": "没办法，这次的事情就不追究了。\n未来、美也，你们明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
